hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"589","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Abi Hathmah (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke un ki qaum ke badon ne unhen khabar di ke Abdullah bin Sahl aur Muhayyisah Khaibar gae us tangi ki wajah se jo unhen pahunchi thi; dono apni hajat ke liye juda hue. Phir Muhayyisah aae aur unhen khabar di gayi ke Abdullah bin Sahl qatl kar diye gae hain aur faqeerv [khushk kunwan] ya chashme mein phaink diye gae hain. To woh Yahud ke paas gae aur kaha: Allah ki qasam, tum ne use qatl kiya hai. Unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam, ham ne use qatl nahin kiya. Phir woh gae yahan tak ke apni qaum ke paas aae; unhon ne un se is ka zikr kiya. Phir woh, un ke bhai Huwayyisah, jo un se bade the, aur Abdur Rahman bin Sahl, maqtool ke bhai aae [Nabi Sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas]. To Muhayyisah bolne lage, jo Khaibar mein the, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Muhayyisah se farmaya: 'Bade se shuru karo, bade se shuru karo', yani umr. To Huwayyisah bole, phir Muhayyisah bole. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ya to woh tumhare sathi ki diyat den, ya unhen jang ka ailaan samjhen.' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unhen is mein likha; unhon ne likha: Beshak ham ne, Allah ki qasam, use qatl nahin kiya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Huwayyisah, Muhayyisah aur Abdur Rahman se farmaya: 'Kya tum qasam khaoge aur apne sathi ke khoon ke mustahiq hoge?' Unhon ne kaha: Nahin. Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya Yahud [pachas qasmen] khayen?' Unhon ne kaha: Woh Musalman nahin hain. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni taraf se us ki diyat di; Aap ne un ki taraf sau oontniyan bhejin yahan tak ke un ke ghar mein dakhil ki gayin. Sahl kehte hain: Un mein se ek surkh oontni ne mujhe thokar mari."
"590","[AI-translation] Bushair bin Yasar (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne use khabar di ke Abdullah bin Sahl Ansari aur Muhayyisah bin Mas'ud Khaibar gae; dono apni hajat ke liye juda hue. To Abdullah bin Sahl qatl kar diye gae. To Muhayyisah aae; woh, un ke bhai Huwayyisah, aur Abdur Rahman bin Sahl, jo maqtool ke bhai hain, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae. To Abdur Rahman apne bhai ki jagah ki wajah se bolne lage. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Bade se shuru karo, bade se shuru karo.' To Muhayyisah aur Huwayyisah bole; unhon ne Abdullah bin Sahl ka mamla zikr kiya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Kya tum pachas qasmen khaoge aur apne maqtool, ya sathi ke khoon ke mustahiq hoge?' To unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, ham hazir nahin the aur maujood nahin the. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'To Yahud tum se pachas qasmon se bari ho jayen?' To unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, ham kafir qaum ki qasmon ko kaise qabool karen? To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ki diyat [baitulmal se] di."
"591","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Abi Hathmah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Sahl Khaibar ke faqeeron [khushk kunwan] mein se ek mein qatl kiye hue paae gae, ya unhon ne kaha: Khaibar ke kunwan mein se ek kunwan mein. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas un ke bhai Abdur Rahman bin Sahl, Huwayyisah aur Muhayyisah aae. To Abdur Rahman bin Sahl bolne lage. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Bada, bada.' To Muhayyisah bole aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah, beshak ham ne Abdullah bin Sahl ko qatl kiya hua paya; aur beshak Yahud kafir aur gaddar hain, wahi hain jinhon ne use qatl kiya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya tum pachas qasmen khaoge aur mustahiq hoge?' To unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, ham us par kaise qasam khayen jis mein ham hazir nahin the aur ham ne dekha nahin. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'To Yahud tum se pachas qasmon se bari ho jayen.' To unhon ne kaha: Ham mushrik qaum ki qasmon ko kaise qabool karen. Ravi kehte hain: To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us ki diyat di. Sahl kehte hain: Us mein se ek bachhdi ne mujhe thokar mari. Tahawi kehte hain: Main ne Muzani ko kehte suna: Muhammad bin Idris Shafi'i (Rahimahullah) ne farmaya: Sufyan use aise hi bayan karte; kabhi farmate: Main nahin janta ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qasam mein Ansar se shuru farmaya ya Yahud se? To un se kaha jata: Beshak log bayan karte hain ke Aap ne Ansar se shuru farmaya. Unhon ne kaha: To aisa hi hai; kabhi woh use baghair shak ke bayan farmate."
"592","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Abi Hathmah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Abdullah bin Sahl Ansari aur Muhayyisah bin Mas'ud Khaibar gae; dono apni hajat ke liye juda hue. To Abdullah bin Sahl qatl kar diye gae. To woh [Muhayyisah], maqtool ke bhai Abdur Rahman, aur Huwayyisah bin Mas'ud gae [Nabi Sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas]; unhon ne Aap se Abdullah bin Sahl ka mamla zikr kiya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kya tum pachas qasmen khaoge aur apne maqtool, ya sathi ke khoon ke mustahiq hoge?' To unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, ham hazir nahin the aur maujood nahin the. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'To Yahud tum se pachas qasmon se bari ho jayen?' To unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah, kya ham kafir qaum ki qasmen qabool karen! To un ka gumaan hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne apni taraf se us ki diyat di [baitulmal se]. Bushair kehte hain: Sahl bin Abi Hathmah ne kaha: Us mein se ek [diyat ka oont] ne hamare baade mein mujhe thokar mari."
